  "kind": "graph",
  "generatedAt": "2026-10-04T23:56:13.571Z",
  "title": "Devcontainer: multi-agent builder image with enforced git hooks",
  "summary": "This change turns the devcontainer into a full builder image: it pins and installs moon, Node/pnpm, Bun, gh, actionlint, uv, the NVIDIA skill linters, and four coding agents (dsh, omp, opencode, codex, claude-code), then wires each agent's own hook system to `osf hook` so prompt and stop events run the project's checks. It also replaces the system-wide `core.hooksPath` with a git wrapper that forces `/opt/factory/githooks` only for repositories under the workspace mount, and adds build-time tests that prove the wrapper, the hooks, the agents and the skills all work for the non-root `dev` user.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
